"复用本机真实发送上下文提交文本；无句柄时排队，捕获后自动重发；仅文本。" = "Submits text through the local real send context; queues while no handle is available and resends after capture; text only.";
"选择「跟随系统」时，App 会实时响应 macOS 的浅色/深色切换。" = "With \"Follow System\", the app responds to macOS light and dark changes immediately.";
"默认通道在「AI 模型 → 全局请求」中设置。停用后不会用于自动回复。" = "Set the default channel in AI Model → Global Requests. Disabled channels are not used for auto-replies.";
"只读探针、不伪造底层对象；发送由设置开启，可随时关闭；真机证据只留本机。" = "Read-only probes that never forge underlying objects; sending is opt-in in Settings and can be turned off anytime; on-device evidence stays local.";
"已清理 app bundle 内旧版 bridge 日志目录（修复签名）" = "Cleaned up the legacy bridge log directory inside the app bundle (fixes code signing)";
"统一填写会话 ID 或用户 wxid；白名单为空表示全部允许，黑名单优先" = "Enter conversation IDs or user wxids. An empty allowlist allows everyone; the blocklist takes precedence.";
"通常是 app 重新构建/重签后钥匙串授权失效：请在「钥匙串访问」删除 " = "This usually means Keychain access was invalidated after the app was rebuilt or re-signed: in Keychain Access, delete ";
"仅监听本机回环地址；启动机器人后自动连接。Token 只保存在本机配置中。" = "Listens on the local loopback address only and connects automatically when the bot starts. The token is stored only in the local configuration.";
"按微信版本维护 Hook 地址表与开关；只在真机验证文本收发后标记为可用。" = "Maintains Hook address tables and switches per WeChat version; a version is marked available only after text send/receive is verified on a real device.";
"本机只读读取通讯录，补全会话标题与群昵称；读不到时回退兜底名，不阻塞消息。" = "Reads contacts locally in read-only mode to fill in conversation titles and group nicknames; falls back to a default name and never blocks messages.";
"核心之间也按权重排序。基础权重可在记忆编辑器中自由调整（0.1~10×）。" = "Core memories are ranked by weight too. Adjust the base weight (0.1–10×) in the memory editor.";
"配置、聊天记忆、日志都保存在本机；API Key 存入 Keychain。" = "Settings, chat memory and logs stay on this Mac; API Keys go into the Keychain.";
" × 0.5^(距最近更新/召回天数 / 30)。基础权重可在上方自由调整；" = " × 0.5^(days since last update/recall / 30). Adjust the base weight above;";
"别人拍机器人时，发送自定义文字和/或 AI 回复，可 @ 拍的人；不再回拍。" = "When someone pats the bot, send custom text and/or an AI reply, optionally @-mentioning them. Never pats back.";
"此操作会修改官方微信的应用包，用于注入消息收发 Hook。请先完全退出微信。" = "This modifies the official WeChat app bundle to inject the messaging Hook. Quit WeChat completely first.";
"清理后无法恢复，AI 也将失去这段上下文。建议先在「设置 → 数据」中备份。" = "This can't be undone, and AI will lose this context. Back up first in Settings → Data.";
"短期窗口外攒够 %d 条旧消息后会自动批量总结；也可以手动新增一条手写记忆。" = "After %d old messages outside the short-term window, a batch summary is generated automatically; you can also add a manual memory.";
"API Key 仅保存在 macOS Keychain，配置文件只记录引用名。" = "The API Key is stored only in the macOS Keychain; the config file records just the reference name.";
"OpenAI 兼容接口（DeepSeek / OpenAI / Ollama）" = "OpenAI-compatible API (DeepSeek / OpenAI / Ollama)";
"主线程看门狗：WECHATAI_DISABLE_WATCHDOG=1，跳过启动" = "Main thread watchdog: WECHATAI_DISABLE_WATCHDOG=1, skipping startup";
"微信 4.1.15.55 / 4.2.0.5 / 4.2.0.9：R3 原生发送已关闭，主动发送不可用（接收不受影响）" = "WeChat 4.1.15.55 / 4.2.0.5: R3 native sending is off. Proactive sending is unavailable (receiving is unaffected).";
"核心记忆在所属会话内优先注入并可自由调整权重；关联“全局记忆”时对所有会话生效" = "Core memories are injected first within their chat and can use a custom weight; linking “Global Memory” applies them to all chats.";
"DeepSeek / OpenAI / Ollama 任一兼容通道，按会话切换。" = "Use any compatible channel — DeepSeek, OpenAI or Ollama — and switch per conversation.";
"仅在「AI 模型 → 全局请求」开启流式回复时生效；全局关闭时所有通道都不流式。" = "Only applies when streaming is on in AI Model → Global Requests; with it off, no channel streams.";
"SwiftUI + Liquid Glass，没有 WebView，空闲时占用低。" = "SwiftUI and Liquid Glass, no WebView, low idle usage.";
"从左侧选择一个聊天，查看消息并在需要时手动发送回复；再次点击当前会话行可收起对话。" = "Pick a chat on the left to read messages and send a manual reply when needed. Click the selected row again to collapse it.";
"将清空 App 内存中的日志缓冲（最多 2000 条）。已落盘的日志文件不受影响。" = "Clears the in-memory log buffer (up to 2000 entries). Log files already on disk are not affected.";
"未找到 bridge 资源目录（onebot 从当前目录读取 script.js）" = "Bridge resource directory not found (onebot reads script.js from the current directory)";
"正在监听微信消息；符合触发条件时会按人设与上下文自动回复。可在页面顶部停止机器人。" = "Listening for WeChat messages. Messages that match your triggers get automatic replies based on the persona and context. Stop the bot at the top of the page.";
"温度不随通道设置，改在「模型温度」中按模型单独配置；未配置时由模型使用自身默认值。" = "Temperature is not set per channel; set it per model in Model Temperature. Models use their own default when unset.";
"读取所需密钥只在本机内存与受限缓存中，不写日志、不下发 App；仅用于自己的账号。" = "Keys needed for reading stay in local memory and a restricted cache, are never logged, and aren't exposed to the app; they're used only for your own account.";
"你在 macOS 微信客户端上以真人身份聊天，回复要简短自然，不要暴露自己是 AI。" = "You're chatting as a real person in the macOS WeChat client. Keep replies short and natural, and never reveal that you're an AI.";
"你是一个友好、自然、简洁的中文微信聊天助手。回答要像真人聊天，避免长篇大论和机械感。" = "You are a friendly, natural, concise Chinese WeChat chat assistant. Reply like a real person would, and avoid long-winded or robotic answers.";
"权重 = 基础权重 × 重要度(1 + 0.12 × log2(1 + 合并条数))" = "Weight = Base Weight × Importance (1 + 0.12 × log2(1 + merged count))";
"SF Symbols + SF Pro / 苹方系统字体，支持 1x / 2x 渲染。" = "SF Symbols and SF Pro / PingFang system fonts, rendered at 1x / 2x.";
"你好呀。今天过得怎么样？我在想周末要不要一起去看电影！如果你有空的话我们可以约个时间。" = "Hey! How's your day going? I was thinking we could go see a movie this weekend! If you're free, let's find a time.";
"所有配置、聊天记忆与日志均保存在 Application Support，不上传云端。" = "All settings, chat memory, and logs are stored in Application Support and never uploaded.";
"数据库与日志的完整备份请直接复制数据目录；微信官方备份由 Hook 安装流程自动创建。" = "For a full backup of the database and logs, copy the data directory; the official WeChat backup is created automatically by the Hook install process.";
"发送顺序：自定义文字（前）→ AI 回复 → 自定义文字（后）；AI 失败时仍发送文字。" = "Order: custom pre-text → AI reply → custom post-text. Text is still sent if AI fails.";
"启动后连接本地 OneBot 服务，开始接收并自动回复微信消息。可在页面顶部启动机器人。" = "Connects to the local OneBot service, then receives WeChat messages and auto-replies. Start the bot at the top of the page.";
"请结合长期记忆中的人员对应关系（wxid→昵称）判断谁在说话，回复时不要输出 wxid。" = "Use the person mappings in long-term memory (wxid→nickname) to tell who's speaking, and never output wxid in replies.";
"OpenAI 兼容接口根地址，例如 https://api.deepseek.com/v1" = "Root URL of the OpenAI-compatible API, e.g. https://api.deepseek.com/v1";
"优先级：会话单独设置 > 机器人默认人格 > 全局默认。人格的系统提示词会直接发送给模型。" = "Priority: per-chat setting > bot default persona > global default. The system prompt is sent to the model as-is.";
"编辑、合并或召回都会抬高权重；基础权重可手工调整并参与排序；越近、越常用的记忆优先级越高。" = "Editing, merging and recalling all raise the weight; the base weight can be adjusted manually and affects ranking; more recent and more frequently used memories rank higher.";
"App 通过 Frida Gadget 注入官方微信，再经本地 OneBot 桥接收发消息。" = "The app injects Frida Gadget into official WeChat and sends and receives messages through a local OneBot bridge.";
"当前版本优先保证聊天窗口内的实时反馈；系统通知会在 Core 接入通知服务后按上述开关发送。" = "This version prioritizes live feedback in the chat window; system notifications follow the switches above once the notification service is wired into Core.";
"未找到 bridge/onebot 可执行文件（请先构建 bridge 或检查 App 资源）" = "bridge/onebot executable not found (build the bridge or check the app resources)";
"首次使用或微信重启后需手动发一条消息；句柄按微信进程缓存，App/bridge 重启自动恢复。" = "Send a message manually on first use or after WeChat restarts; the handle is cached per WeChat process and restored when the app or bridge restarts.";
"bridge 进程：附加 Gadget、接收事件、HTTP/WS 发送接口与鉴权、媒体上传/下载" = "Bridge process: attaches to the Gadget, receives events, serves authenticated HTTP/WS send APIs, and uploads/downloads media";
"修改官方微信可能导致无法启动、无法更新或触发安全检查。请仅在了解风险的本机环境使用，并保留备份。" = "Modifying the official WeChat may prevent it from launching or updating, or trigger security checks. Use it only on your own Mac with the risks understood, and keep the backup.";
"已忽略与 image_path 账号目录不一致的 self_id，bridge 将按目录重新推导" = "Ignored a self_id that doesn't match the image_path account directory; the bridge will re-derive it from the directory";
"选择一个 OpenAI 兼容通道并保存 API Key。密钥只写入 macOS Keychain。" = "Choose an OpenAI-compatible channel and save the API Key. Keys are written only to the macOS Keychain.";
"入站使用只读消息钩子；出站走原生发送（默认开启，可关闭），与 4.1.12 legacy 互相隔离。" = "Inbound uses a read-only message hook; outbound uses native sending (on by default, can be turned off), isolated from the 4.1.12 legacy path.";
"微信 4.1.15.55 / 4.2.0.5 / 4.2.0.9：启用 R3 原生发送（首次使用前需在本机微信手动发一条消息以捕获发送句柄）" = "WeChat 4.1.15.55 / 4.2.0.5: enable R3 native sending (before first use, send a message manually in WeChat on this Mac to capture the send handle)";
"微信接口只下发会话 ID，App 取不到真实昵称；给常用会话起名后，列表、AI 提示词与日志都会使用它。" = "WeChat only provides the chat ID, so the app can't read real nicknames. Once you name a chat, the list, AI prompts and logs all use it.";
"%d 条长期记忆 · 核心 %d · 短期窗口 %d 条 · 每 %d 条批量总结 · 本地 SQLite" = "%d long-term memories · core %d · short-term window %d · batch summary every %d · local SQLite";
"Frida Gadget 文件缺失：hook/gadget/FridaGadget.dylib 或配置文件" = "Frida Gadget files missing: hook/gadget/FridaGadget.dylib or its config file";
"安装流程：完整备份 → 注入 Frida Gadget → ad-hoc 重签 → 校验。安装前请退出微信。" = "Install steps: full backup → inject Frida Gadget → ad-hoc re-sign → verify. Quit WeChat before installing.";
"完整备份 /Applications/WeChat.app → 注入 Gadget → ad-hoc 重签。" = "Full backup of /Applications/WeChat.app → inject Gadget → ad-hoc re-sign.";
"定时任务由 App 内调度器执行，仅当机器人运行且 OneBot 已连接时才会真正发送。时间以系统时区为准。" = "Schedules run in the app's scheduler and only send while the bot is running and OneBot is connected. Times use the system time zone.";
"机器人会连接本地 OneBot 服务并按触发设置与人设自动回复。所有开关都可以在侧边栏「机器人」中随时调整。" = "The Bot connects to the local OneBot service and replies automatically using your trigger settings and Personas. Change any switch anytime in the Bot section of the sidebar.";
"核心记忆优先占用注入名额（最多 %d 条），核心之间也按综合权重排序；保存会刷新更新时间，时间衰减从头计算。" = "Core memories take priority for injection slots (up to %d) and are sorted by combined weight; saving refreshes the timestamp and restarts time decay.";
"会先完整备份 /Applications/WeChat.app，再注入 Gadget 并 ad-hoc 重签。" = "Fully backs up /Applications/WeChat.app, then injects Gadget and re-signs ad-hoc.";
"启动机器人后会连接本地 OneBot 桥接。若仍无法连接，请在设置 → Hook 中检查微信与 Hook 状态。" = "Starting the bot connects to the local OneBot bridge. If it still can't connect, check WeChat and Hook status in Settings → Hook.";
"需要已安装官方微信 4.1.15.55 / 4.2.0.5 / 4.2.0.9（arm64）。安装 Hook 会修改微信应用包，请先退出微信并确认了解风险。" = "Requires official WeChat 4.1.15.55 / 4.2.0.5 (arm64). Installing the Hook modifies the WeChat app bundle, so quit WeChat first and make sure you understand the risks.";
"仅阻止系统因空闲进入睡眠，不会阻止合盖睡眠、手动睡眠，也不会让显示器保持点亮。使用电池且选择「接入电源时」时不会阻止。" = "Only blocks idle system sleep. It doesn't block lid-close or manual sleep and doesn't keep the display awake. When on battery with \"On power adapter\" selected, it stays inactive.";
"登录项需要 App 以 .app 形式安装后生效。启动时显示主窗口；关闭窗口后 App 继续在菜单栏运行，Dock 图标只在主窗口打开期间出现，菜单栏图标始终保留。" = "The login item works only when the app is installed as a .app. The main window opens at launch; after you close it, the app keeps running in the menu bar. The Dock icon appears only while the main window is open, and the menu bar icon is always available.";
"会先完整备份 /Applications/WeChat.app，再注入 Frida Gadget 并 ad-hoc 重签。" = "The app first makes a full backup of /Applications/WeChat.app, then injects Frida Gadget and re-signs it ad hoc.";
"密钥保存在 Keychain（service com.gusionw.wechatai），不会写入 config.json。" = "Keys are stored in the Keychain (service com.gusionw.wechatai) and never written to config.json.";
"未找到应用资源目录（bridge/hook/tools）；请通过 App bundle 或 WECHATAI_ROOT 运行" = "App resource directory not found (bridge/hook/tools). Run from the app bundle or set WECHATAI_ROOT.";
"未找到微信媒体临时目录（xwechat_files/<账号>/temp）；请先登录微信，或在设置中填写 image_path" = "WeChat media temp directory not found (xwechat_files/<account>/temp). Sign in to WeChat or set image_path in Settings.";
"App 全部界面与服务层：Swift Concurrency、SQLite WAL 记忆库、Keychain、IOKit 防睡眠" = "Entire app UI and service layer: Swift Concurrency, SQLite WAL memory store, Keychain, IOKit sleep prevention";
"微信 4.1.15.55 / 4.2.0.5 / 4.2.0.9 专用原生文本发送。首次使用前需在本机微信手动发一条消息以捕获发送句柄；排队消息会在拿到句柄后自动重发。" = "Native text sending for WeChat 4.1.15.55 / 4.2.0.5. Before first use, send a message manually in WeChat to capture the send handle; queued messages are resent automatically once it's captured.";
"仅群聊生效；@ 附在第一条回复前（自定义前文字 → AI 首段 → 自定义后文字）。bridge 解析不到群昵称时按普通文本发送。" = "Group chats only. The @-mention goes before the first reply (custom pre-text → first AI paragraph → custom post-text). Sent as plain text if bridge can't resolve the group nickname.";
"唯一实例方案：Gadget 注入后由 bridge 经 frida-core 附加，脚本读取/调用 wechat.dylib 内部函数" = "Single-instance approach: after Gadget injection, the bridge attaches via frida-core and the script reads and calls internal wechat.dylib functions";
"OneBot 仅监听 127.0.0.1，不暴露到局域网。请勿将端口转发到公网；如更换 Token，需要同时更新正在运行的 bridge。" = "OneBot listens on 127.0.0.1 only and isn't exposed to the LAN. Don't forward the port to the internet; if you change the token, update the running bridge as well.";
"权重越高越优先进入提示词；核心记忆优先占用注入名额（最多 %d 条），核心之间也按权重排序。基础权重可在记忆编辑器中自由调整（0.1~10×）。" = "The higher the weight, the earlier it enters the prompt; core memories take priority for injection slots (up to %d), and cores are sorted by weight as well. Base weight can be adjusted in the memory editor (0.1–10×).";
"API Key 保存在 macOS Keychain（service com.gusionw.wechatai），config.json 仅保存 Keychain 引用名。" = "API Keys are stored in the macOS Keychain (service com.gusionw.wechatai); config.json only keeps the Keychain reference name.";
"Hook 版本适配、4.1.15 / 4.2 收发、原生发送与通讯录读取均为本项目自研；上游仅提供基线脚本、地址查找工具与 OneBot 协议实现。具体地址、结构与密钥细节不在界面展开。" = "Hook version adaptation, 4.1.15 / 4.2 send/receive, native sending, and contact reading are all built in-house; upstream provides only baseline scripts, address lookup tools, and the OneBot protocol implementation. Specific addresses, structures, and key details aren't exposed in the UI.";

