"识图结果保存在本机，并随消息作为后续回复的上下文；建议选择支持图片输入的模型（如 gpt-4o-mini、qwen-vl-max）。" = "Recognition results are stored on this Mac and travel with the message as context for later replies; prefer a model that accepts image input (e.g. gpt-4o-mini, qwen-vl-max).";
